{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞太經合組織第33次領導人非正式會議，月中將會在深圳舉行，主題為「建設亞太共同體，促進共同繁榮」。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有澳洲學者接受深圳廣電直新聞專訪時認為，深圳在讓創意落地的速度領先全球，期望各國透過亞太經合組織這個重要平台，破除地域隔閡。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:01:17.713758+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:31:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:40:19.903063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:34.162733+00:00","content_hash":"c3eee6ddc9220eaa8637d4658d0d0af3c25b9e3289e1538c6af7ef1f0b9a7ba4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}